  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo de Emergencia a Poblaciones Vulnerables Afectadas por Coronavirus</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Support for Vulnerable Populations Affected by Coronavirus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de desarrollo general del proyecto es contribuir a asegurar niveles mnimos de calidad de vida de las personas vulnerables frente a la crisis causada por el COVID-19. Su objetivo especfico es apoyar niveles mnimos de ingreso y de empleo de personas afectadas por el coronavirus en el periodo inmediato y durante la recuperacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to contribute to guarantee minimum levels of welfare for vulnerable populations due to the crisis triggered by COVID-19. The specific objective is to support minimum levels of income and employment for people affected by the Coronavirus, in the short run and during recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
